---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="页面未找到" description="404 页面">
  <section class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center px-5 py-28 text-center">
    <p class="font-display text-7xl font-semibold text-accent">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">这里还没有章节</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-muted">你要找的内容可能被移动了，或尚未写好。</p>
    <a href="/" class="mt-8 rounded-full bg-accent px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">
      返回首页
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
